#Units standing idle for long periods will slowly recover stamina.
New defensive structure: Watchtower that increases detection range.
Improved pathfinding for large armies moving through narrow terrain.
Supply shortages now reduce unit morale over time.
Added banner customization for player factions.
AI factions may now form temporary alliances against dominant players.
New soundtrack tracks added for desert and winter biomes.
Siege ladders can be destroyed while units are climbing them.
Fixed issue where catapults occasionally launched projectiles into the void instead of the enemy.
